<!--
  One URL, and that is not an oversight.

  A sitemap lists what should be indexed, and this site has exactly one indexable
  document: the landing page. The app at /app is noindex, and its routes live in the
  URL fragment, which is never a separate URL to a crawler. Padding this with #features
  anchors would list the same page five times.

  Add an entry here whenever a genuinely new indexable path ships - docs, a changelog,
  a comparison page - and update `lastmod` when its content changes, not on every deploy.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
